{"seq":1,"slug":"simd-datapath-lane-execution-model","title":"SIMD 数据通路与向量执行模型：寄存器文件、lane 与执行端口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpu-simd-vectorization-avx-neon-intrinsics-engineering/simd-hardware-vector-model/simd-datapath-lane-execution-model","wordCount":2712,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"simd-数据通路与向量执行模型-寄存器文件-lane-与执行端口\">SIMD 数据通路与向量执行模型：寄存器文件、lane 与执行端口</h1><p>一条 <code>vaddps zmm0, zmm1, zmm2</code> 在 Intel Sapphire Rapids 上并不&quot;一次做 16 件事&quot;，而是驱动 16 条并排的浮点加法器、在同一周期内各自完成一次 <code>float</code> 加法。理解 SIMD 性能的第一步，是把&quot;向量&quot;这个 ISA 概念翻译成微架构里的三个物理部件：<strong>向量寄存器文件 (VRF)</strong>、<strong>lane 化的执行单元</strong>、以及决定它们能否被喂饱的<strong>执行端口 (execution port) 与调度器</strong>。本文给出这套映射关系的可操作模型，后续的 intrinsics 技巧与自动向量化调优都建立在这层认知上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-寄存器-lane-与端口的三角关系\">核心概念：寄存器、lane 与端口的三角关系</h2><p>向量寄存器文件是&quot;被编号的物理存储&quot;，执行端口是&quot;计算资源的入口&quot;，lane 是&quot;数据通路的位宽切片&quot;。ISA 只暴露前者的架构视图，后两者是微架构私有的事实 —— 这也是为什么同一段 AVX2 代码在 Intel 与 AMD 上跑出不同 IPC。</p>\n<p>一条向量指令的生命周期可以拆成五段：取指解码 → 寄存器重命名（把架构寄存器映射到物理寄存器）→ 分发到某个端口 → 执行单元逐 lane 运算 → 写回 VRF。任何一段成为瓶颈，向量宽度带来的理论加速就兑现不了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[取指与解码&lt;br/&gt;1-4 条指令/周期] --&gt; B[重命名与分配&lt;br/&gt;架构寄存器 → 物理寄存器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[调度器分发&lt;br/&gt;按端口能力选择]&#10;    C --&gt; D0[Port 0/1/5&lt;br/&gt;向量 ALU 与 FMA]&#10;    C --&gt; D1[Port 5&lt;br/&gt;shuffle/permute]&#10;    C --&gt; D2[Port 2/3 载入&lt;br/&gt;Port 4/7 存储]&#10;    D0 --&gt; E[逐 lane 执行&lt;br/&gt;W 条并排数据通路]&#10;    D1 --&gt; E&#10;    D2 --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[写回向量寄存器文件]&#10;    F --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[取指与解码&lt;br/&gt;1-4 条指令/周期] --&gt; B[重命名与分配&lt;br/&gt;架构寄存器 → 物理寄存器]\n    B --&gt; C[调度器分发&lt;br/&gt;按端口能力选择]\n    C --&gt; D0[Port 0/1/5&lt;br/&gt;向量 ALU 与 FMA]\n    C --&gt; D1[Port 5&lt;br/&gt;shuffle/permute]\n    C --&gt; D2[Port 2/3 载入&lt;br/&gt;Port 4/7 存储]\n    D0 --&gt; E[逐 lane 执行&lt;br/&gt;W 条并排数据通路]\n    D1 --&gt; E\n    D2 --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[写回向量寄存器文件]\n    F --&gt; B</pre><p>不同 ISA 暴露的架构向量寄存器数量差异显著，而它们的<strong>宽度</strong>决定了单指令的数据并行度上限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ISA / 扩展</th>\n<th>架构向量寄存器</th>\n<th>单寄存器宽度</th>\n<th>每寄存器 lane 数（32-bit 浮点）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>x86 SSE (128-bit)</td>\n<td>16 个 XMM（x86-64）</td>\n<td>128 bit</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>x86 AVX2</td>\n<td>16 个 YMM</td>\n<td>256 bit</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>x86 AVX-512</td>\n<td><strong>32 个 ZMM</strong>（x86-64）+ 8 个 k 掩码寄存器</td>\n<td>512 bit</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AArch64 NEON (ASIMD)</td>\n<td>32 个 V</td>\n<td>128 bit</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AArch64 SVE / SVE2</td>\n<td>32 个 Z + 16 个 P 谓词</td>\n<td>128–2048 bit 可变</td>\n<td>4–64（可变，VLA）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RISC-V V (RVV)</td>\n<td>32 个 v</td>\n<td>VLEN 可变</td>\n<td>由 VLEN/vsew 决定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（x86 侧以 Intel 64 and IA-32 Architectures Software Developer&#39;s Manual 的寄存器模型为准；AArch64 侧见 ARM Architecture Reference Manual for A-profile，SVE 部分在 SVE supplement。RVV 见 RISC-V &quot;V&quot; Vector Extension 规范。）</p>\n<p><strong>关键推论一</strong>：AVX-512 相比 AVX2 的收益不只在宽度翻倍，还在架构寄存器从 16 个变成 32 个。寄存器文件名空间扩大，直接减轻了重命名压力与编译器 spill，这是很多混合负载里 AVX-512 比&quot;宽度理论值&quot;表现更好的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>关键推论二</strong>：SVE 的 lane 数是运行时确定的（由实现选择 128–2048 bit），程序用&quot;向量长度无关 (VLA)&quot;的方式编写。这牺牲了&quot;我确切知道有 16 个 lane&quot;的确定性，换来跨代际二进制兼容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"执行端口-向量计算的真正闸门\">执行端口：向量计算的真正闸门</h2><p>从 Intel Skylake 大核开始，向量运算被集中到固定的几个端口上，这一布局延续到 Golden Cove / Sapphire Rapids（第三方逆向与 uops.info 的测量一致；Intel 官方优化手册 Vol. 1 的 port 表也给出了对应资源）。其要点是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>浮点/整数向量 ALU 与 FMA</strong>：主要落在 Port 0、Port 1、Port 5。Golden Cove 上 512-bit FMA 可在 Port 0 与 Port 5 执行，Port 1 处理 256-bit 及以下。</li>\n<li><strong>Shuffle / permute / 跨 lane 移动</strong>：历史上<strong>只有 Port 5</strong> 能执行。这意味着任何 <code>vpermd</code>、<code>vpshufb</code>、<code>vperm2f128</code> 都会与 FMA 争抢 Port 5，形成典型的结构性冲突。</li>\n<li><strong>载入</strong>：Port 2/3；<strong>存储地址</strong>：Port 7；<strong>存储数据</strong>：Port 4。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>AMD 的向量数据通路布局不同。Zen 4 有 4 条浮点/向量流水线（FP0–FP3），AVX-512 指令以&quot;双泵&quot;方式拆成两个 256-bit 微操作执行，因此 512-bit FMA 的吞吐等价于 2 条 256-bit FMA；Zen 5 的消费级与服务器大核把数据通路加宽到原生 512-bit，512-bit FMA 吞吐相应翻倍（AMD Zen 4 与 Zen 5 Software Optimization Guide 的 FP 流水线章节）。Apple 大核（Firestorm 及其后继）维持 4 条 128-bit FP/SIMD 流水线，以 128-bit 宽度靠高主频与宽发射取胜。</p>\n<p>把这些数字放进一张可比较的表，就是选型与调优时的第一手依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>微架构</th>\n<th>向量 FMA 吞吐（每周期执行的 256-bit FMA 当量）</th>\n<th>shuffle 端口数</th>\n<th>AVX-512 原生宽度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Intel Skylake-X / Cascade Lake</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1（Port 5）</td>\n<td>是（512-bit，需 license 降频）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intel Ice Lake / Sapphire Rapids</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1（Port 5）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMD Zen 4</td>\n<td>4（256-bit）</td>\n<td>多条</td>\n<td>双泵（256-bit 内部）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMD Zen 5</td>\n<td>8（256-bit 当量）</td>\n<td>多条</td>\n<td>原生 512-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apple Firestorm 及后继</td>\n<td>4（128-bit 当量）</td>\n<td>多条</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实践含义</strong>：当 kernel 里 shuffle 与乘法比例接近 1:1 时，Intel 大核会先撞上 Port 5 而不是浮点单元总量。这解释了一个反直觉现象 —— 把手写 reduction 改成 <code>vfmadd</code> 累加 + 末尾一次横向求和，往往比&quot;节约乘法&quot;的写法更快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lane-与掩码-横向操作为什么昂贵\">Lane 与掩码：横向操作为什么昂贵</h2><p>lane 之间默认是<strong>数据隔离</strong>的：lane <em>i</em> 的输出只依赖 lane <em>i</em> 的输入。这类逐 lane 操作（加、乘、FMA、min/max）可以满吞吐执行。一旦运算需要跨 lane（求和归约、转置、点积的横向部分），就必须用 shuffle 网络把数据搬到同一个 lane，成本随宽度上升。</p>\n<p>宽度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的向量做完全归约，朴素的二分 shuffle 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil \\log_2 W \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\lceil \\log_2 W \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对 512-bit 的 16 个 <code>float</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>；对 128-bit 的 4 个 <code>float</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>。每一步都是 Port 5 上的 shuffle，因此宽向量的归约会成倍放大 shuffle 压力 —— 这正是&quot;先把多组累加器做垂直累加，最后再横向收一次&quot;这一模式的硬件依据。</p>\n<p>AVX-512 引入的 8 个掩码寄存器（k0–k7，其中 k0 不能作为多数谓词指令的写目标）改变了尾部与条件分支的写法。掩码化 (masking) 让&quot;最后一个不满向量&quot;的尾块处理不再需要标量回退或 blend：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 用掩码处理尾块，避免标量循环或越界读写&#10;__mmask16 tail = (__mmask16)0xFFFF &gt;&gt; (16 - remaining);&#10;__m512 acc = _mm512_maskz_loadu_ps(tail, ptr);      // 只载入有效 lane&#10;acc = _mm512_mul_ps(acc, _mm512_set1_ps(scale));&#10;_mm512_mask_storeu_ps(out, tail, acc);               // 只写回有效 lane\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用掩码处理尾块，避免标量循环或越界读写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">__mmask16 tail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (__mmask16)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FFFF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">__m512 acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _mm512_maskz_loadu_ps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tail, ptr);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 只载入有效 lane</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _mm512_mul_ps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(acc, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_mm512_set1_ps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scale));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_mm512_mask_storeu_ps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(out, tail, acc);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               // 只写回有效 lane</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SVE 把这一思想推广为<strong>每 lane 谓词寄存器 P</strong>，且谓词与向量长度同步随实现缩放。用 <code>whilelt</code> 生成谓词、用 <code>svadd_f32_m</code> 带谓词运算，同一份源码即可在 128-bit 与 2048-bit 的硬件上正确运行 —— 代价是编译器无法把 lane 数硬编码进调度，某些场合会牺牲部分调度自由度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前端与调度-宽度之外的第二瓶颈\">前端与调度：宽度之外的第二瓶颈</h2><p>即使有足够宽的 ALU，如果调度器喂不上指令，峰值也达不到。判断一个循环能否跑满某个端口，用&quot;依赖链长度 ÷ 吞吐&quot;这个比值：若某类指令的延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 个周期、端口吞吐为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 条/周期，则需要至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 路独立指令级并行（ILP）才能填满流水线。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ILP_{required} = \\frac{L}{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Intel 大核的向量 FMA 延迟通常为 4 个周期、Port 0/1/5 合计吞吐约 2 条/周期，因此需要约 2 路独立累加链才能打满。这直接对应代码里的经验规则：<strong>至少开 4 个独立累加器</strong>（超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 后收益递减，但留余量可吸收调度抖动与内存延迟）。</p>\n<p>寄存器压力是另一侧约束。物理寄存器文件是有限资源，一旦活跃向量变量超出可分配的重命名容量，编译器只能插入 spill/reload，把向量运算退化成访存带宽问题。AVX-512 的 32 个架构寄存器缓解了这一点，而 128-bit 的 NEON 只有 32 个 V 寄存器、每条 FMA 覆盖 4 个 lane，同样规模的计算更容易触及压力上限。</p>\n<p>单核向量单元的峰值可用一条公式估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{peak} = N_{core} \\times W_{lane} \\times 2 \\times f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中因子 2 来自 FMA（一次乘加 = 2 FLOP），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 为实际运行频率。一个 8 核、每核 16 lane、跑 3.5 GHz 的 AVX-512 服务器，理论峰值约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>896</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8 \\times 16 \\times 2 \\times 3.5 \\times 10^9 \\approx 896</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">896</span></span></span></span></span> GFLOP/s（单精度）。但这条公式的分母端很快会见顶：单核 AVX-512 的 L1/L2 供数能力与 DRAM 带宽远低于这个数，因此除了 L1 常驻的小 kernel，多数真实负载是<strong>内存带宽受限</strong>而非端口受限。测出实际 FLOP/s 与天天花板的比值，比争论 AVX-512 该不该用更有意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频率-功耗与-宽向量的税\">频率、功耗与&quot;宽向量的税&quot;</h2><p>宽向量单元的瞬时功耗密度高，历史上触发了频率协商机制。Intel 在 Skylake-X 一代引入 AVX-512 license 分层（L0/L1/L2），执行越&quot;重&quot;的向量指令，核频率降得越多，且降频效应会传播到同封装的其他核（Intel Xeon Scalable 平台的官方调优文档描述了这一机制）。Ice Lake 与 Sapphire Rapids 显著淡化了 license 的影响，数据中心负载上的净收益通常来自每周期完成的运算量而非频率。</p>\n<p>AMD 的路线不同：Zen 4 用双泵 256-bit 实现 512-bit，官方优化指南与第三方测评均未观察到与 Intel Skylake-X 同量级的频率惩罚，代价是 512-bit 指令的吞吐只是 256-bit 的两倍而非&quot;一次到位&quot;。这形成一个务实的选型结论：<strong>在 AMD 上，AVX-512 更像&quot;省寄存器、省指令条数&quot;的收益；在 Intel 大核上，它才接近&quot;宽度直接换吞吐&quot;。</strong></p>\n<p>实际性能可用三层折扣表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{real} \\approx P_{peak} \\times \\frac{f_{turbo}}{f_{base}} \\times U_{port} \\times U_{mem}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{port}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反映端口争用（典型是 Port 5 上的 shuffle 冲突），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{mem}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反映访存受限程度。调优的实质就是逐个抬高这两个利用率因子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三个部件决定 SIMD 性能</strong>：向量寄存器文件（容量 + 架构寄存器数量）、lane 化执行单元（宽度）、执行端口（数量与分工）。ISA 只暴露第一个，后两者要靠微架构文档与实测逆向。</li>\n<li><strong>寄存器数量的隐性收益</strong>：AVX-512 的 32 个 ZMM 常比 512-bit 宽度本身更重要，它降低重命名压力与 spill。</li>\n<li><strong>Intel 大核上 Port 5 是总线</strong>：shuffle/permute 与 FMA 争用同一端口，跨 lane 操作是性能杀手。</li>\n<li><strong>AMD 与 Apple 的布局不同</strong>：Zen 4 双泵、Zen 5 原生 512-bit、Apple 坚持 128-bit 宽通路高主频；代码的可移植性取决于是否只依赖&quot;逐 lane 语义&quot;这一公共子集。</li>\n<li><strong>横向量要压到最后</strong>：完全归约需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil \\log_2 W \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 步 shuffle，先把多路垂直累加器做满再做一次横向收尾。</li>\n<li><strong>先算再测</strong>：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{peak} = N \\times W \\times 2 \\times f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 估上界，再判断瓶颈在端口、频率还是内存带宽，然后才决定调优方向。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步是把这套模型落到具体的指令选择与数据搬运上 —— 见同章节的 <a href=\"../intrinsics-data-movement/\">intrinsics 数据搬运与内存布局</a>，那里讨论载入/存储、广播、对齐与 gather/scatter 在端口层面的代价。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SIMD 数据通路与向量执行模型：寄存器文件、lane 与执行端口","id":"simd-数据通路与向量执行模型-寄存器文件-lane-与执行端口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：寄存器、lane 与端口的三角关系","id":"核心概念-寄存器-lane-与端口的三角关系"},{"level":2,"text":"执行端口：向量计算的真正闸门","id":"执行端口-向量计算的真正闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"Lane 与掩码：横向操作为什么昂贵","id":"lane-与掩码-横向操作为什么昂贵"},{"level":2,"text":"前端与调度：宽度之外的第二瓶颈","id":"前端与调度-宽度之外的第二瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"频率、功耗与\"宽向量的税\"","id":"频率-功耗与-宽向量的税"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"指令集谱系对比：AVX2/AVX-512/NEON/SVE 的掩码、宽度与编码约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpu-simd-vectorization-avx-neon-intrinsics-engineering/simd-hardware-vector-model/isa-portfolio-avx2-avx512-neon-sve"}}